{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2025-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1750032000, "end_date": 1750636799, "month_true_total": 139, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:25:07 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "197917607", "author": {"steamid": "76561198105445916", "personaname": "Fugitive Mind", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fugitive-mind/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 249, "playtime_forever": 789, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 554, "last_played": 1752183943, "avatar": "5c05ca99de3ebc0ccf3a54f64ed2d78175d7ddaa"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game starts to open up in its second campaign, and the shooting mechanics are relatively fun. However, the story is practically nonexistent and the grinding is very real here. You need to replay missions a bit before you're finally ready for the next campaign, then more grinding. \r\n\r\nOkay Gears of War clone. I think that's the best way to describe it.", "timestamp_created": 1750631217, "timestamp_updated": 1750631217, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197883816", "author": {"steamid": "76561199571728635", "personaname": "aidaaaaan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199571728635/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 579, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 334, "last_played": 1750704833, "avatar": "14013c7a2d07242b35d8770d9fc3ec297d1041c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "dont buy this unless you like shooting aliens and nothing else, going to complete so no money wasted, but its bad bad", "timestamp_created": 1750602993, "timestamp_updated": 1750602993, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197871723", "author": {"steamid": "76561198160381376", "personaname": "respegg the egg", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198160381376/", "num_games_owned": 435, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 1018, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1018, "last_played": 1720981483, "avatar": "9d51aaf33334e21b92b3f4a5712148bf2b33c485"}, "language": "english", "review": "For an alien fan, this game was a lot of fun. The combat is not too deep, but it's engaging enough to keep you entertained through the whole story.", "timestamp_created": 1750593199, "timestamp_updated": 1750593199, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197861437", "author": {"steamid": "76561198125801463", "personaname": "PlatinumBlonde99", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198125801463/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1033, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 632, "last_played": 1751700034, "avatar": "2038f2b2ce0ea7d0ed28a9b050cd1f8f8f5e55f1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good Game - Wouldn't play it for the story (Story is the reason button mashing was invented) and It's incredibly short about 15-20 Hours including DLC and you would have explored everything the game has to offer but if you get it at a low price and enjoy playing with friends online its well worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1750583210, "timestamp_updated": 1750583210, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197829916", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028080243", "personaname": "Lemmy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198028080243/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 7126, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5169, "last_played": 1753666791, "avatar": "4d5f2616fb6bc5f698f41e85dcb2229eaf2a4f97"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun game to play with friends.\r\n\r\nNothing particularly innovative, but the gameplay is fun and the level design is solid.\r\nThere's a decent amount of enemy variety (except for 1 mission).\r\n\r\nAside from that, the attention to detail when it comes to lore is great.\r\nIf you're a fan of the Alien franchise (especially the first 2 movies), you'll definitely enjoy all the references.\r\nHearing the iconic Pulse Rifle noises was great!\r\n\r\nBut make sure to play with friends! My one complaint is that the AI bots are REALLY bad... They block your line of sight and/or deal friendly fire damage all the time! \r\n\r\n[b]tl;dr:[/b] Simple but fun game with lots of references to the Alien franchise.", "timestamp_created": 1750547507, "timestamp_updated": 1750547507, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1629777600", "reactions": []}]}